{"id":179,"date":"2025-02-20T09:57:39","date_gmt":"2025-02-20T09:57:39","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/eaglebayshipping.com\/?page_id=179"},"modified":"2026-03-17T14:02:59","modified_gmt":"2026-03-17T14:02:59","slug":"trucking","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/dongzhanshipping.com\/trucking\/","title":{"rendered":"Trucking"},"content":{"rendered":"<div id=\"pl-179\"  class=\"panel-layout\" ><div id=\"pg-179-0\"  class=\"panel-grid panel-no-style\"  style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\" ><div id=\"pgc-179-0-0\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\" ><div id=\"panel-179-0-0-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-editor panel-first-child panel-last-child\" data-index=\"0\" ><div\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tclass=\"so-widget-sow-editor so-widget-sow-editor-base\"\n\t\t\t\n\t\t>\n<div class=\"siteorigin-widget-tinymce textwidget\">\n\t<h3><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Trucking<\/span><\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: #333333;\">At Gosford Storage and Logistics Ltd., we have countless oil and gas petroleum fuel tankers trucks of all various types and sizes that are rendered for lease to customers for the delivering of oil and gas petroleum fuel to various destinations within domestic (local) and international cross border locations. Gosford Storage and Logistics Ltd. tanker trucks operational drivers\u2019 team are pioneers in the industry, with long lasting records and extensive history in terms of tankers trucks handling driving skills with a high precision intensive level experience in truck tanker handling, loading and shipments both in urban and rural areas, for temperature sensitive control shipments or special offloading requirements.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: #333333;\">At Gosford Storage and Logistics Ltd., we operate and have fleets of solid tanker trucks built with the finest materials by the finest engineers that can withstand any form of pressure prior to the oil and gas petroleum fuel safety during shipment, with a diverse driving sense of skill from our drivers that understand all types of road network for inland transports both domestically and internationally. We operate in several transflo oil and gas petroleum terminals, where our truck tankers can easily access and breakthrough. Our customers can leverage the relationships we have developed with our core group of carriers to build even stronger partnerships of their own.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: #333333;\">Our tanker trucks teams are well knowledgeable in the truck tanker handling and shipping industry for basically all transportation processes. Customers with unique, extensive requirements can rest assured that their needs will be met. We handle it all, from temperature sensitive shipping to bulk tanker truck loading. Our core group of carriers is experienced with specialty shipping as well, especially with truck tankers, we have more than enough trucks available worldwide to serve the needs of our customers for truck tanker demands.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: #333333;\">In the dynamic realm of oil and gas, specialized tools drive success. specialty truck parts, these powerhouse vehicles aren't just ordinary haulers; they are precision-engineered solutions for the unique challenges of the industry. Curious about the backbone of oil and gas operations? From rig transport to fluid hauling, we are unveiling the crucial roles these trucks play. Get ready to explore the cutting-edge features that boost efficiency, safety, and performance. From heavy-duty chassis to advanced pumping systems, we are shedding light on the innovation that keeps the industry moving. Join us as we uncover the world of specialty trucks for the oil and gas sector, a journey that unveils the machinery that powers progress.<\/span><\/p>\n<div class=\"host-lopnbnfpjmgpbppclhclehhgafnifija\" style=\"position: relative; z-index: 2147483647;\"><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><div id=\"pgc-179-0-1\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\" ><div id=\"panel-179-0-1-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-image panel-first-child\" data-index=\"1\" style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\" ><div\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tclass=\"so-widget-sow-image so-widget-sow-image-default-8b5b6f678277-179\"\n\t\t\t\n\t\t>\n<div class=\"sow-image-container\">\n\t\t<img \n\tsrc=\"https:\/\/dongzhanshipping.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/tRUCK.jpg?wsr\" width=\"276\" height=\"183\" sizes=\"(max-width: 276px) 100vw, 276px\" alt=\"\" \t\tclass=\"so-widget-image\"\/>\n\t<\/div>\n\n<\/div><\/div><div id=\"panel-179-0-1-1\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-image panel-last-child\" data-index=\"2\" ><div\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tclass=\"so-widget-sow-image so-widget-sow-image-default-8b5b6f678277-179\"\n\t\t\t\n\t\t>\n<div class=\"sow-image-container\">\n\t\t<img \n\tsrc=\"https:\/\/dongzhanshipping.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/tghggggg.jpg?wsr\" width=\"529\" height=\"612\" srcset=\"https:\/\/dongzhanshipping.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/tghggggg.jpg 529w, https:\/\/dongzhanshipping.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/tghggggg-259x300.jpg 259w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 529px) 100vw, 529px\" alt=\"\" \t\tclass=\"so-widget-image\"\/>\n\t<\/div>\n\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div id=\"pg-179-1\"  class=\"panel-grid panel-has-style\"  style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\" ><div class=\"siteorigin-panels-stretch panel-row-style panel-row-style-for-179-1\" style=\"padding: 3% 0% 0% 0%;\" data-stretch-type=\"full\" ><div id=\"pgc-179-1-0\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\" ><div id=\"panel-179-1-0-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_siteorigin-panels-builder panel-first-child panel-last-child\" data-index=\"3\" ><div id=\"pl-w69b95f133c740\"  class=\"panel-layout\" ><div id=\"pg-w69b95f133c740-0\"  class=\"panel-grid panel-has-style\"  style=\"mar